[a97746c1] 2026-10-22T08:10:07.090Z: Pad US state codes with leading zeros when merging geospatial data, especially when joining state and county FIPS codes.
[ae243e26] 2026-10-22T07:40:07.152Z: Be cautious with date parsing from ISO 8601 strings, especially if input is in 4-digit year format. In UTC, 2022-01-01T00:00:00 is treated as 20220101, not 20010101.
